 *   (g_pObjectMgr, *GUID, g_GameStateFlags) -- OM enumerates live and /wl cast
 *   on a real target, so these are CORRECT, not stale. SAFE MODE is OFF.
 *
 * NOT sig/dump-verifiable (harmless):
